"cxx:Error:iohandler.cc:line135:argument of type "ClientData" is incompatible
with parameter of type "int"
    Tk_CreateFileHandler((ClientData)fd, mask, callback, (ClientData)this)
    ----------------------^

If anyone managed to compile VIC using the 'CXX', please let me know.

I am using DU4.0d, AV321 video controller, MMERT242 and AlphaStation 200.

Eric
eric.chin@bbsrc.ac.uk


