Hi All,

I received quite a few responses on the defrag question.  Thanks to the
many who responded (too many to list).

The overall feeling is that running and not running the defrag could
cause the system to panic.  Use defragment -vn to determine how often to
run on your system.  A few are not running it at all, while some still
run it through the cron and some suggested running manually.  Always run
it after a full backup.

Mary

