My question was : 

> On an AlphaStation 200, i'd like to change the graphic
> resolution ( 800x600 =3d> 1024x768 ).
> The problem is that i don't know how to do that :-)

The answer is :

Change the file Xservers (in /usr/dt/config) so that the 
important line looks like

   :0   Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0 -screen 
1280x1024 -vsync 72

And the most simple to take effect is to reboot.

Arnaud.

