> all CDs, i.e. 4.0D & firmware 7.0 (CD, I think it is 6.2-20 for
> PWSs). ASAP hasn't yet shipped me 4.0E before you ask.
/snip/

To change back to AlphaBIOS select BIOS setting from the menu and then
press F10 for advanced settings. Then simply tab down to the O/S selection
and select Digital UNIX. Save these settings to BIOS.

BTW, you may want to check the CMOS battery or the battery connection. We
have a DPW 500au which did exactly the same until I bent the battery
connection arm onto the battery.
[I speak for myself. I take no responsibility for your actions.]

Regards,
Rich

